<title>PHILIPPINES: Ayala Land 9-mth net up 34 percent.</title>
<headline>Ayala Land 9-mth net up 34 percent.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30.</p>
<p>	    (in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover (billion)	     9.60 vs 7.60</p>
<p>    Net income (billion)	   3.27 vs 2.43</p>
<p>Note: Full name Ayala Land Inc. Company said earnings were buoyed by strong residential, commercial and industrial lot sales, as well as higher rental income from its new office building and shopping centers.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom (632) 841-8937</p>
</text>
